const special=['cero','uno','dos','tres','cuatro','cinco','seis','siete','ocho','nueve','diez','once','doce','trece','catorce','quince','dieciséis','diecisiete','dieciocho','diecinueve','veinte','veintiuno','veintidós','veintitrés','veinticuatro','veinticinco','veintiséis','veintisiete','veintiocho','veintinueve'];
const tens=['','','','treinta','cuarenta','cincuenta','sesenta','setenta','ochenta','noventa'];
function spanish(n){return n===100?'cien':n<30?special[n]:tens[Math.floor(n/10)]+(n%10?' y '+special[n%10]:'')}
const app=document.querySelector('#app');let mode='listen',selected=1,range=100,target=1,round=1,recognition=null,generation=0,voices=[];
const SR=window.SpeechRecognition||window.webkitSpeechRecognition;
function loadVoices(){voices=window.speechSynthesis?.getVoices()||[]}loadVoices();window.speechSynthesis?.addEventListener('voiceschanged',loadVoices);
function stop(){generation++;if(recognition){recognition.abort();recognition=null}window.speechSynthesis?.cancel()}
function speak(n){const status=document.querySelector('#audio-status');if(!window.speechSynthesis){if(status)status.textContent='这个浏览器暂不支持朗读，请换一个浏览器试试。';return}loadVoices();const voice=voices.find(v=>v.lang==='es-ES')||voices.find(v=>v.lang.startsWith('es'));window.speechSynthesis.cancel();const utterance=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(typeof n==='number'?spanish(n):n);utterance.lang='es-ES';utterance.rate=.8;if(voice)utterance.voice=voice;utterance.onerror=e=>{if(e.error!=='interrupted'&&e.error!=='canceled'&&status)status.textContent='读音暂时无法播放，请检查设备的西班牙语语音包或稍后再试。'};if(status)status.textContent='';window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance)}
function home(){stop();app.innerHTML=`<section class="home-intro"><div class="eyebrow">HOLA, EXPLORADOR</div><h1>今天，练点什么？</h1><p>选一个主题，听一听、说一说，把西班牙语变成你的拿手好戏。</p></section><div class="section-label">你的练习主题 <span>01 个主题</span></div><a class="topic-card" href="#numbers"><div class="number-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="corner">LOS NÚMEROS</span><div class="big">1 · 2 · 3</div><span class="word">uno, dos, tres</span></div><div class="topic-content"><span class="pill">本期主题 · 入门</span><h2>数字 0–100</h2><div class="subtitle">Los números del 0 al 100</div><div class="skills"><span>听读</span><span>口语</span><span>拼写</span></div><span class="primary">开始练习 <span>↗</span></span></div></a><p class="next-note">本主题含课堂拓展：看图数物 · uno / un / una。</p>`}
function render(){stop();if(location.hash!=='#numbers'){home();return}app.innerHTML=`<a href="#" class="back">← 所有主题</a><div class="page-head"><div><div class="topic-number">主题 01 · LOS NÚMEROS</div><h1>数字 0–100</h1><p>从 cero 到 cien，一起掌握西语数字。</p></div><div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="练习模式"><button data-mode="listen" class="${mode==='listen'?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${mode==='listen'}">♫ 听一听</button><button data-mode="quiz" class="${mode==='quiz'?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${mode==='quiz'}">✎ 测一测</button><button data-mode="hearing" class="${mode==='hearing'?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${mode==='hearing'}">♫ 听音辨数</button><button data-mode="application" class="${mode==='application'?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${mode==='application'}">数字应用</button></div></div><section class="workspace"><div class="toolbar"><div><h3>${mode==='listen'?'小数字，大声读':mode==='quiz'?'轮到你来挑战了':mode==='hearing'?'用耳朵找到数字':'把数字用起来'}</h3><p>${mode==='listen'?'按住数字，听发音、看拼写；也可以直接点击。':mode==='quiz'?'先说出数字，再写下它的西班牙语。':mode==='hearing'?'先听读音，再输入你听到的阿拉伯数字。':'跟着课堂材料，练习数量和数字的变化。'}</p></div><div class="range" aria-label="练习范围" ${mode==='application'?'hidden':''}>${[10,20,50,100].map(n=>`<button data-range="${n}" class="${range===n?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${range===n}">0–${n}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>${mode==='listen'?listenHTML():mode==='quiz'?quizHTML():extraHTML()}<div id="audio-status" class="status" role="status"></div></section><p class="hint">${mode==='listen'?'小提示：西语中的重音符号也很重要哦，比如 dieciséis、veintidós。朗读使用设备提供的西班牙语声音。':'语音反馈依据识别结果，不是专业发音评分。启用麦克风后，浏览器可能将音频发送至其语音服务；本站不保存录音或答案。'}</p>`;bind()}
function listenHTML(){return `<div class="listen-layout"><div class="grid">${Array.from({length:range+1},(_,i)=>`<button class="num ${selected===i?'selected':''}" data-n="${i}" aria-label="听数字 ${i}" aria-pressed="${selected===i}">${i}</button>`).join('')}</div><aside class="readout" aria-live="polite"><span class="caption">跟着读一读</span><strong id="selected-number">${selected}</strong><span class="spell" id="selected-spell" lang="es">${spanish(selected)}</span><button class="sound" id="replay" aria-label="再听一次">♫</button><p>点击音符，再听一次</p></aside></div>`}
function quizHTML(){return `<div class="quiz-layout"><div class="challenge"><span>第 ${round} 题 · 用西班牙语怎么说？</span><strong>${target}</strong><p>先试一试，再看答案</p></div><div class="exercise"><div class="exercise-block"><h3><span class="step">1</span>说出来</h3><button class="secondary" id="record" ${!SR?'disabled':''}>♩ 点击开始说</button><p id="speech-feedback" class="feedback neutral" role="status">${SR?'点击后允许使用麦克风，说出这个数字。':'此浏览器不支持语音识别，可换用支持的 Chrome 浏览器；也可以继续拼写练习。'}</p></div><form id="spelling" class="exercise-block"><h3><label for="answer"><span class="step">2</span>写下来</label></h3><input id="answer" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="输入西班牙语数字…" aria-describedby="write-feedback"><div class="accents" aria-label="输入重音字母">${['á','é','í','ó','ú','ñ'].map(l=>`<button type="button" data-char="${l}">${l}</button>`).join('')}</div><button class="secondary" type="submit">检查拼写</button><p class="feedback" id="write-feedback" role="status"></p></form></div></div><div class="quiz-bottom"><button class="secondary" id="reveal">听读答案</button><button class="primary" id="next">下一题 →</button></div><p class="feedback neutral" id="reveal-answer" role="status"></p>`}
function pick(){const old=target;do{target=Math.floor(Math.random()*(range+1))}while(target===old)}
function normalize(s){return s.normalize('NFC').toLowerCase().trim().replace(/[.,!?¡¿]/g,'').replace(/\s+/g,' ')}
function select(n){selected=n;document.querySelectorAll('.num').forEach(b=>{const on=Number(b.dataset.n)===n;b.classList.toggle('selected',on);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(on))});document.querySelector('#selected-number').textContent=n;document.querySelector('#selected-spell').textContent=spanish(n);speak(n)}
function bind(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{mode=b.dataset.mode;if(mode==='quiz'||mode==='hearing'){round=1;pick()}render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-range]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{range=+b.dataset.range;if(selected>range)selected=1;if(mode==='quiz'||mode==='hearing'){round=1;pick()}render()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-n]').forEach(b=>{b.onpointerdown=e=>{if(e.pointerType==='mouse'&&e.button!==0)return;select(+b.dataset.n)};b.onclick=e=>{if(e.detail===0)select(+b.dataset.n)};b.oncontextmenu=e=>e.preventDefault()});const replay=document.querySelector('#replay');if(replay)replay.onclick=()=>speak(selected);bindExtra();const form=document.querySelector('#spelling');if(!form)return;form.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const value=normalize(document.querySelector('#answer').value);const feedback=document.querySelector('#write-feedback');const correct=spanish(target);if(!value){feedback.textContent='先写下你的答案吧。';feedback.className='feedback neutral';return}const good=value===correct;feedback.className='feedback '+(good?'good':'bad');feedback.textContent=good?'✓ 拼写正确，真棒！':value.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'')===correct.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'')?'差一点点，注意重音符号：'+correct:'再试试！正确拼写是：'+correct};document.querySelectorAll('[data-char]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const input=document.querySelector('#answer');input.setRangeText(b.dataset.char,input.selectionStart,input.selectionEnd,'end');input.focus()});document.querySelector('#next').onclick=()=>{round++;pick();render()};document.querySelector('#reveal').onclick=()=>{document.querySelector('#reveal-answer').textContent=target+' · '+spanish(target);speak(target)};document.querySelector('#record').onclick=record}
function record(){if(!SR)return;if(recognition){recognition.stop();return}window.speechSynthesis?.cancel();const button=document.querySelector('#record'),feedback=document.querySelector('#speech-feedback');const current=generation;const question=target;const rec=new SR();recognition=rec;rec.lang='es-ES';rec.interimResults=false;rec.maxAlternatives=5;let received=false;button.textContent='■ 正在听，点击结束';button.classList.add('recording');feedback.textContent='请说出这个数字…';feedback.className='feedback neutral';rec.onresult=e=>{if(current!==generation)return;received=true;const result=Array.from(e.results[0]);const ok=result.some(v=>normalize(v.transcript)===spanish(question)||normalize(v.transcript)===String(question));feedback.className='feedback '+(ok?'good':'bad');feedback.textContent=ok?'✓ 识别正确！听到的是「'+result[0].transcript+'」。':'听到的是「'+result[0].transcript+'」。还没有匹配，听读答案后再试一次吧。'};rec.onerror=e=>{if(current!==generation)return;received=true;feedback.className='feedback bad';feedback.textContent=({'not-allowed':'麦克风权限未开启，请在浏览器设置中允许后重试。','audio-capture':'没有找到麦克风，请检查设备。','network':'语音服务暂时连接不上，请稍后再试。','no-speech':'没有听到声音，靠近麦克风再试一次。','language-not-supported':'当前语音服务不支持西班牙语，请换一个浏览器试试。','aborted':'录音已停止。'})[e.error]||'语音识别暂不可用，请稍后再试。'};rec.onend=()=>{if(current!==generation)return;recognition=null;button.textContent='♩ 再说一次';button.classList.remove('recording');if(!received)feedback.textContent='没有识别到答案，再试一次吧。'};try{rec.start()}catch{recognition=null;button.textContent='♩ 点击重试';button.classList.remove('recording');feedback.textContent='无法启动麦克风，请检查浏览器权限后重试。'}}
const produce=[
 {image:'oranges',noun:'naranjas',cn:'橙子',gender:'f',count:9},
 {image:'eggplants',noun:'berenjenas',cn:'茄子',gender:'f',count:3},
 {image:'cherries',noun:'cerezas',cn:'樱桃',gender:'f',count:8},
 {image:'carrots',noun:'zanahorias',cn:'胡萝卜',gender:'f',count:7},
 {image:'cucumbers',noun:'pepinos',cn:'黄瓜',gender:'m',count:9}
];
const unoQuestions=[
 {prompt:'单独数数：1 = ___',answer:'uno',sentence:'uno',why:'单独说数字 1，用 uno。'},
 {prompt:'一个西红柿：___ tomate',answer:'un',sentence:'un tomate',why:'tomate 是阳性名词，前面的 uno 变成 un。'},
 {prompt:'一个橙子：___ naranja',answer:'una',sentence:'una naranja',why:'naranja 是阴性名词，前面用 una。'},
 {prompt:'一根黄瓜：___ pepino',answer:'un',sentence:'un pepino',why:'pepino 是阳性名词，前面用 un。'},
 {prompt:'一个茄子：___ berenjena',answer:'una',sentence:'una berenjena',why:'berenjena 是阴性名词，前面用 una。'},
 {prompt:'一根胡萝卜：___ zanahoria',answer:'una',sentence:'una zanahoria',why:'zanahoria 是阴性名词，前面用 una。'},
 {prompt:'一颗樱桃：___ cereza',answer:'una',sentence:'una cereza',why:'cereza 是阴性名词，前面用 una。'}
];
let application='count',produceIndex=0,unoIndex=0,heard=false;
function extraHTML(){if(mode==='hearing')return `<div class="quiz-layout"><div class="challenge"><span>第 ${round} 题 · 听音辨数</span><button class="hear-play" id="hear-play" aria-label="播放待猜数字">♫</button><p>这是什么数字？</p></div><form id="hearing-form" class="exercise"><h3><label for="heard-answer">写下你听到的数字</label></h3><p>点击音符播放，需要时可以再听一次。</p><input id="heard-answer" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="例如：23" aria-describedby="hearing-feedback"><button class="secondary" type="submit">检查答案</button><p id="hearing-feedback" class="feedback" role="status"></p></form></div><div class="quiz-bottom"><button class="secondary" id="hear-reveal">查看答案</button><button class="primary" id="hear-next">下一题 →</button></div>`;
const item=produce[produceIndex];const q=unoQuestions[unoIndex];return `<div class="application-nav" role="group" aria-label="数字应用练习"><button class="secondary ${application==='count'?'chosen':''}" data-application="count" aria-pressed="${application==='count'}">看图数物</button><button class="secondary ${application==='uno'?'chosen':''}" data-application="uno" aria-pressed="${application==='uno'}">uno 的变化</button></div>${application==='count'?`<div class="quiz-layout"><div class="produce-image"><img src="/assets/${item.image}.png" alt="请数一数图中的${item.cn}"><span>${item.noun} · ${item.cn}</span></div><div class="exercise"><h3 lang="es">¿${item.gender==='f'?'Cuántas':'Cuántos'} ${item.noun} hay?</h3><p>图里有多少${item.cn}？用西班牙语补全回答。</p><button class="secondary" id="count-question">♫ 听问题</button><form id="count-form"><label for="count-answer" class="answer-label">Hay…（有……）</label><input id="count-answer" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="填写西班牙语数字" aria-describedby="count-feedback"><button class="secondary" type="submit">检查答案</button><p id="count-feedback" class="feedback" role="status"></p></form></div></div><p class="hint">问复数数量时：阳性名词用 ¿Cuántos…?，阴性名词用 ¿Cuántas…?。例如 pepinos 搭配 Cuántos，naranjas 搭配 Cuántas。</p><div class="quiz-bottom"><button class="secondary" id="count-reveal">听读答案</button><button class="primary" id="count-next">下一张 →</button></div>`:`<div class="rule-examples"><div><strong>uno</strong><span>单独数数</span><small>数字 1 → uno</small></div><div><strong>un</strong><span>阳性名词前</span><small>un tomate · 一个西红柿</small></div><div><strong>una</strong><span>阴性名词前</span><small>una naranja · 一个橙子</small></div></div><div class="uno-practice"><span class="eyebrow">选一选</span><h2>${q.prompt}</h2><div class="uno-options">${['uno','un','una'].map(v=>`<button class="secondary" data-uno="${v}">${v}</button>`).join('')}</div><p id="uno-feedback" class="feedback" role="status"></p></div><div class="quiz-bottom"><button class="secondary" id="uno-reveal">听读答案</button><button class="primary" id="uno-next">下一题 →</button></div>`}<p class="hint">练习内容依据《文来荟萃班 西班牙语七年级 第1–3周》。</p>`}
function feedback(id,text,good){const el=document.getElementById(id);el.textContent=text;el.className='feedback '+(good===null?'neutral':good?'good':'bad')}
function bindExtra(){heard=false;if(mode==='hearing'){
 document.getElementById('hear-play').onclick=()=>{heard=true;speak(target)};
 document.getElementById('hearing-form').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const v=document.getElementById('heard-answer').value.trim();if(!heard){feedback('hearing-feedback','先点击音符听一听吧。',null);return}if(!/^\d+$/.test(v)){feedback('hearing-feedback','请输入一个阿拉伯数字，比如 23。',null);return}const ok=Number(v)===target;feedback('hearing-feedback',ok?'✓ 听对了！'+target+' · '+spanish(target):'还没听对，再播放一次试试。',ok)};
 document.getElementById('hear-reveal').onclick=()=>feedback('hearing-feedback','答案：'+target+' · '+spanish(target),null);
 document.getElementById('hear-next').onclick=()=>{round++;pick();render()};
 }if(mode!=='application')return;
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-application]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{application=b.dataset.application;render()});
 if(application==='count'){const item=produce[produceIndex];const answer='Hay '+spanish(item.count)+'.';
 document.getElementById('count-question').onclick=()=>speak('¿'+(item.gender==='f'?'Cuántas':'Cuántos')+' '+item.noun+' hay?');
 document.getElementById('count-form').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const v=normalize(document.getElementById('count-answer').value);if(!v){feedback('count-feedback','先数一数，再写下答案吧。',null);return}const ok=v===spanish(item.count)||v===normalize(answer);feedback('count-feedback',ok?'✓ 答对了！'+answer:'再数一数，用西班牙语数字回答。',ok)};
 document.getElementById('count-reveal').onclick=()=>{feedback('count-feedback',answer,null);speak(answer)};
 document.getElementById('count-next').onclick=()=>{produceIndex=(produceIndex+1)%produce.length;render()};
 }else{const q=unoQuestions[unoIndex];document.querySelectorAll('[data-uno]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const ok=b.dataset.uno===q.answer;feedback('uno-feedback',(ok?'✓ 正确！':'再想想。')+' '+q.why,ok)});
 document.getElementById('uno-reveal').onclick=()=>{feedback('uno-feedback',q.sentence+' — '+q.why,null);speak(q.sentence)};
 document.getElementById('uno-next').onclick=()=>{unoIndex=(unoIndex+1)%unoQuestions.length;render()};}
}

window.addEventListener('hashchange',render);window.addEventListener('pagehide',stop);render();
